:name: Mycelium Sentinel — STM32F4 Discovery
:description: Boots the Mycelium Sentinel firmware on an emulated STM32F407 and shows the UART4 boot banner. The firmware path defaults to the local build output; override with `bin=/path/to/firmware-bin` on the `i` command.

using sysbus
mach create "Mycelium_Sentinel"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery-kit.repl

cpu PerformanceInMips 125

# Default firmware path: the local release build. Override from the monitor
# prompt with `i @renode/stm32f4_mycelium.resc bin=/abs/path/to/firmware-bin`.
$bin?="/home/michaelf/Desktop/mycelium-sentinel/target/thumbv7em-none-eabi/release/firmware-bin"

# Show the UART4 output in the Renode log/analyzer.
showAnalyzer sysbus.uart4

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset